{"sha": "98927265555f206b17a48f6ba4171f9b8d2e21309d212833befe033479924991", "body": ["\\chapter{随机变量与二项分布}\\label{ch:g12:randvar}", "", "随机变量为试验的每一个结果赋予一个数：", "如增益、计数或持续时间。其期望是其取值的长期平均，", "方差则刻画这些取值的分散程度。本章的重点是二项分布，", "它统计独立重复试验中成功的次数。", "随机变量与二项分布首见于", "\\cref{ch:g11:prob,ch:g11:binom}；本章对二者加以复习和深化，", "并借助\\cref{ch:g12:comb}中的组合工具，", "现已能够更深入地展开。", "", "\\section{离散型随机变量}", "", "\\begin{definition}[随机变量，分布]\\label{def:g12:randvar:rv}", "\\emph{随机变量}\\index{随机变量}是定义在有限样本空间", "$\\Omega$ 上的函数 $X \\colon \\Omega \\to \\R$。", "其\\emph{分布}\\index{分布}（又称律）由可能取值", "$x_1, \\dots, x_k$ 及下列概率所构成的数据：", "\\[", "p_i = \\P(X = x_i), \\qquad \\sum_{i=1}^{k} p_i = 1 .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[期望、方差与标准差]\\label{def:g12:randvar:exp}", "\\emph{期望}\\index{期望}为随机变量 $X$：", "\\[", "\\E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} p_i\\, x_i ,", "\\]", "其\\emph{方差}\\index{方差}与\\emph{标准差}分别为", "\\[", "\\V(X) = \\E\\bigl((X - \\E(X))^2\\bigr) = \\sum_{i=1}^k p_i\\bigl(x_i - \\E(X)\\bigr)^2,", "\\qquad", "\\sigma(X) = \\sqrt{\\V(X)} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[柯尼希--惠更斯公式]\\label{prop:g12:randvar:konig}", "\\index{柯尼希--惠更斯公式}", "$\\V(X) = \\E(X^2) - \\E(X)^2$.", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "记 $m = \\E(X)$，展开可得：", "\\[", "\\V(X) = \\sum_i p_i (x_i^2 - 2m x_i + m^2)", "= \\E(X^2) - 2m\\sum_i p_i x_i + m^2\\sum_i p_i", "= \\E(X^2) - 2m^2 + m^2 . \\qedhere", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[仿射变换]\\label{prop:g12:randvar:affine}", "对 $a, b \\in \\R$，有：", "\\[", "\\E(aX + b) = a\\,\\E(X) + b, \\qquad", "\\V(aX + b) = a^2\\,\\V(X) .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "第一式即定义式中求和的重排。对第二式，$aX + b$", "与其均值的偏差为 $a(X - \\E(X))$，平方后乘以", "$a^2$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[公平游戏]\\label{ex:g12:randvar:game}", "一次游戏需付 $2$ 欧元；掷一枚骰子，玩家所得为", "掷出的点数（若不小于 $5$），否则一无所得。增益 $G$ 的取值为", "$-2$（概率为 $\\frac46$）、$3$（$\\frac16$）、$4$（$\\frac16$）：", "\\[", "\\E(G) = \\frac{-8 + 3 + 4}{6} = -\\frac{1}{6} < 0 .", "\\]", "平均而言，玩家每局损失 $17$ 欧分，这个游戏对玩家不利", "（与大多数实际游戏一样）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{伯努利试验与二项分布}", "", "\\begin{definition}[伯努利分布]\\label{def:g12:randvar:bernoulli}", "\\emph{伯努利试验}\\index{伯努利试验}是只有两种结果的试验，", "其结果分别为\\emph{成功}（概率为 $p$）与\\emph{失败}", "（$q = 1 - p$）。成功的示性变量 $X$（成功时 $X = 1$，", "失败时为 $0$）服从\\emph{伯努利分布} $\\mathcal B(p)$：", "\\[", "\\E(X) = p, \\qquad \\V(X) = p(1-p) .", "\\]", "（事实上 $\\E(X) = p$，$\\E(X^2) = p$，由柯尼希--惠更斯公式可得", "$\\V(X) = p - p^2$。）", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[二项分布]\\label{def:g12:randvar:binomial}", "将一次伯努利试验独立重复 $n$ 次，记 $X$ 为", "成功的总次数。$X$ 的分布称为\\emph{二项", "分布}\\index{二项分布} $\\mathcal B(n, p)$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\coordinate (root) at (0,0);", "  \\node (S) at (1.6,1.6) {成};", "  \\node (F) at (1.6,-1.6) {败};", "  \\node (SS) at (3.2,2.4) {成};", "  \\node (SF) at (3.2,0.8) {败};", "  \\node (FS) at (3.2,-0.8) {成};", "  \\node (FF) at (3.2,-2.4) {败};", "  \\node (SSS) at (4.8,2.8) {成};", "  \\node (SSF) at (4.8,2.0) {败};", "  \\node (SFS) at (4.8,1.2) {成};", "  \\node (SFF) at (4.8,0.4) {败};", "  \\node (FSS) at (4.8,-0.4) {成};", "  \\node (FSF) at (4.8,-1.2) {败};", "  \\node (FFS) at (4.8,-2.0) {成};", "  \\node (FFF) at (4.8,-2.8) {败};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (root) -- (S);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (S) -- (SS);   \\draw[omThm, thick] (SS) -- (SSF);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (S) -- (SF);   \\draw[omThm, thick] (SF) -- (SFS);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (root) -- (F);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (F) -- (FS);   \\draw[omThm, thick] (FS) -- (FSS);", "  \\draw[gray] (SS) -- (SSS);", "  \\draw[gray] (SF) -- (SFF);", "  \\draw[gray] (FS) -- (FSF);", "  \\draw[gray] (F) -- (FF);", "  \\draw[gray] (FF) -- (FFS);", "  \\draw[gray] (FF) -- (FFF);", "  \\node[gray, anchor=west] at (5.3,2.8) {$X=3$};", "  \\node[omThm, anchor=west] at (5.3,2.0) {$X=2$};", "  \\node[omThm, anchor=west] at (5.3,1.2) {$X=2$};", "  \\node[gray, anchor=west] at (5.3,0.4) {$X=1$};", "  \\node[omThm, anchor=west] at (5.3,-0.4) {$X=2$};", "  \\node[gray, anchor=west] at (5.3,-1.2) {$X=1$};", "  \\node[gray, anchor=west] at (5.3,-2.0) {$X=1$};", "  \\node[gray, anchor=west] at (5.3,-2.8) {$X=0$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}